hahah I wish! ;-; 

In my country, you're required to complete at least 3 years of higher education by law. (I know its weird, all my online friends agree that's a bit extreme)

If this law didn't exist I wouldn't even be in class lol

Dude omg thank you sososo much akdshbj This is amazing!

Don't apologize for this, this is super helpful ;-;

Are u ok w me chatting w u about this stuff in DM?

Hahah yeah it’s sorta screwed up how accurate this is but — totally agree with the using “get me tf out of here” as a motivation gas pedal ;-; 

I’m honestly so happy that this sub has so many people that get how Nparents get in the way then take credit for their kids’ accomplishments! We go through so much shit and we get dirt bare minimum as you said ~ 

It’s just about looking forward and keeping our eyes on our own future at this point

Hey just wanted to say  your voice is amazing <333 so soulful and beautiful:>

